# Campaign results (Fase H3): ignored by default - future, larger
# campaigns should not be committed wholesale. The small C01-C04
# validation campaigns are explicitly un-ignored below: they double as
# fixtures the notebooks/article/*.ipynb notebooks read (never
# re-running a campaign themselves - see docs/campaign_architecture.md).
results/raw/*
!results/raw/C01_routing_strategy/
!results/raw/C02_fidelity_throughput/
!results/raw/C03_assurance_outcomes/
!results/raw/C04_reconciliation_effectiveness/
!results/raw/P00_variability_study/

